# SDK Extension HTML

Use semantic plain HTML. Do not emit Ember, React, web-component, or `Ulx*` component syntax.

Start every widget document with these dependencies in this order:

```html
<script src="https://static.zohocdn.com/backstage/v1.0/javascript/sdk/ZSDK.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://static.zohocdn.com/backstage/v1.0/javascript/sdk/bs-frame-client.js"></script>
```

Include the compiled kit CSS (theme tokens + Tailwind utilities) for the widget iframe. Prefer the page build output from this repo (`dist/<page>/assets/*.css`) or the shared kit stylesheet when embedding.

## Layout & theme

- Use `<html class="h-full">`, `<body class="h-full m-0 ulx-default-mode">`, and a full-size main container when the widget owns its iframe.
- Keep `ulx-default-mode` (and optional `ulx-dark-mode` / accent theme classes) on `<body>` so kit CSS variables resolve; do not use ULX component classes.
- Style with **Tailwind utilities** and kit token colors from `tailwind.config.js` / `src/theme/tokens.css`.
- Prefer token-backed colors: `bg-body`, `bg-surface`, `bg-surface-2`, `text-text`, `text-text-secondary`, `text-text-muted`, `text-primary`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`, `text-primary-fg`, `bg-danger`, `bg-success`.
- Compose layout with utilities: `flex`, `flex-col`, `items-center`, `justify-between`, `gap-*`, `m-*`, `p-*`, `w-full`, `h-full`, `min-h-full`, `overflow-*`, `rounded-md` / `rounded-lg`.
- Avoid custom CSS, inline styles, and hard-coded hex colors when a Tailwind or token class exists.
- Use semantic controls (`button`, `input`, `select`, `textarea`, `table`) with labels and accessible names.
- Decorative icons use `aria-hidden="true"`; meaningful images have useful `alt` text.
- Hidden state must keep the `hidden` attribute and `hidden` class synchronized when both are used.
- Render untrusted values with `textContent`; do not inject them through `innerHTML`.

## Preferred patterns

```html
<body class="h-full m-0 ulx-default-mode bg-body text-text">
  <main class="flex h-full min-h-full flex-col gap-4 p-6">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="inline-flex min-h-btn-m items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary px-3 text-small font-medium text-primary-fg"
    >
      Save
    </button>

    <label class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
      <span class="text-small font-medium text-text">Name</span>
      <input
        class="min-h-btn-m w-full rounded-md border border-border bg-surface px-2 text-default text-text"
        type="text"
      />
    </label>

    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-5">
      Content
    </div>

    <div
      class="rounded-md border border-border bg-danger/10 px-3 py-2 text-small text-danger"
      role="alert"
    >
      Unable to save.
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
```

When class names are uncertain, check `tailwind.config.js`, `src/theme/tokens.css`, and `docs/UI-DESIGN-RULES.md` before using them.
